### Error Testing for Starkvault API
### This file tests various error conditions and edge cases

### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Test Data
@validEmail = error-test@example.com
@validPassword = password123
@validName = Error Test User

###
### AUTHENTICATION ERRORS
###

### 1. Signup with Missing Fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{validEmail}}"
}

###
### 2. Signup with Invalid Email Format
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{validName}}",
  "email": "invalid-email-format",
  "password": "{{validPassword}}"
}

###
### 3. Signup with Short Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{validName}}",
  "email": "{{validEmail}}",
  "password": "123"
}

###
### 4. Signup with Empty Name
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "{{validEmail}}",
  "password": "{{validPassword}}"
}

###
### 5. Login with Non-existent User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nonexistent@example.com",
  "password": "{{validPassword}}"
}

###
### 6. Login with Wrong Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{validEmail}}",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###
### 7. Login with Missing Fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{validEmail}}"
}

###
### 8. Access Protected Route Without Authentication
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

###
### 9. Logout Without Authentication
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout

###
### UPLOAD ERRORS
###

### 10. Upload Without Authentication
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/file
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=error1

--error1
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Test content
--error1--

###
### 11. Upload Without File
### First login to get authentication
# @name loginForUpload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{validName}}",
  "email": "{{validEmail}}",
  "password": "{{validPassword}}"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{validEmail}}",
  "password": "{{validPassword}}"
}

###
### 12. Upload Without File (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/file
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=error2

--error2
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Upload without file
--error2--

###
### 13. Upload with Invalid Boolean for isPublic
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/file
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=error3

--error3
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Test content
--error3
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="isPublic"

invalid-boolean
--error3--

###
### DOCUMENT ACCESS ERRORS
###

### 14. Get Non-existent Document
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/document/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011

###
### 15. Get Document with Invalid ID Format
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/document/invalid-id

###
### 16. Delete Non-existent Document
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/document/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011

###
### 17. Delete Document with Invalid ID Format
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/document/invalid-id

###
### 18. Get File with Non-existent Arweave Hash
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/file/nonexistent-arweave-hash

###
### 19. Get Status for Non-existent Arweave Hash
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/status/nonexistent-arweave-hash

###
### PAGINATION ERRORS
###

### 20. Get Documents with Invalid Page Number
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/documents?page=-1

###
### 21. Get Documents with Invalid Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/documents?limit=0

###
### 22. Get Documents with Very Large Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/documents?limit=10000

###
### MALFORMED REQUESTS
###

### 23. Send Invalid JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{validEmail}}",
  "password": "{{validPassword}}"
  // Missing comma - invalid JSON
}

###
### 24. Send Wrong Content-Type for JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: text/plain

{
  "email": "{{validEmail}}",
  "password": "{{validPassword}}"
}

###
### 25. Access Non-existent Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nonexistent

###
### 26. Use Wrong HTTP Method
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login

###
### DUPLICATE DATA ERRORS
###

### 27. Try to Signup with Existing Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Another User",
  "email": "{{validEmail}}",
  "password": "{{validPassword}}"
}

###
### LARGE DATA TESTS
###

### 28. Upload with Very Long Description
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/file
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=error4

--error4
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Test content
--error4
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

This is an extremely long description that goes on and on and on to test how the system handles very long descriptions. It contains many words and sentences that might cause issues if there are length limits or if the system doesn't handle long text properly. This description continues for a very long time to ensure we test the boundaries of what the system can handle in terms of description length and content processing capabilities.
--error4--

###
### 29. Upload with Many Tags
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/file
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=error5

--error5
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Test content
--error5
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tags"

tag1,tag2,tag3,tag4,tag5,tag6,tag7,tag8,tag9,tag10,tag11,tag12,tag13,tag14,tag15,tag16,tag17,tag18,tag19,tag20,verylongtagnamethatshouldtestlimits,anotherlongtagname,yetanotherlongtagname
--error5--

###
### SPECIAL CHARACTERS TESTS
###

### 30. Upload with Special Characters in Filename
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/file
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=error6

--error6
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test-file-with-special-chars-!@#$%^&*()_+.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Test content with special characters
--error6--

###
### 31. Signup with Special Characters in Name
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User with Special Chars !@#$%^&*()",
  "email": "special-chars@example.com",
  "password": "{{validPassword}}"
}